<title>FRANCE: Commercial court confirms Air Liberte decision.</title>
<headline>Commercial court confirms Air Liberte decision.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The commercial court of the Paris suburb of Creteil confirmed it had decided that airline Air Liberte, in administration since September 26, could remain in business, the court's president Dominique Leveque said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The court has decided to maintain the activity and not to turn the administration into a liquidation,&quot; Leveque said by telephone.</p>
<p>He added that a meeting of Air Liberte creditors would be called between now and mid-December.</p>
</text>
